# Qoder's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-qoder-setting-cookie = 您的 Qoder 浏览器会话。登录 https://qoder.com/account/usage（或 https://qoder.com.cn/account/usage），打开“开发者工具 > 应用 > Cookie”，选择 qoder.com（或 qoder.com.cn），将该站点所有 Cookie 合并复制为一个请求头：“name=value; name2=value2”。
usage-qoder-setting-site = 账号所属的 Qoder 站点：“global”表示 qoder.com（默认），“china”表示 qoder.com.cn。

## The report: the plan's credits, with any shared pool added. The China
## site's domain (qoder.com.cn) stays as written.

usage-qoder-credits = 点数
usage-qoder-credits-left = 剩余点数
